Description: Utility functions for clinical trials and data science:
    descriptive statistics (summaries with optional custom stats, quartiles,
    median CI, geometric mean), SDTM/ADaM helpers (date conversion,
    supplemental merge, XPT batch load), table builders, batch data loading,
    and utilities (z-score, CV, SWOE, AUC, EAIR, Newcombe CIs, AR(1) simulation).
